      <description>&lt;p&gt;学科&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;history&#34;&gt;history&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The First Industrial Revolution(The Steam Age,Mechanized)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;time: 1760s to mid-19th century&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Starting from the UK, it spread to countries like France and the US.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Second Industrial Revolution(The Electric Age)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;time: 1870s-1880s to the late 19th century and early 20th century&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Starting at the same time in the UK, the US, Germany, and other countries.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Third Industrial Revolution(Information Age,Automation)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;time: From the 1950s to now&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;In the US, the USSR, and the UK&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
